            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Automatic updates

- WaveType now updates itself: it lets you know in the menu bar when a new version is available and installs it in one click.
- In Help → Send Feedback you can post your report or suggestion on GitHub.

## New in 0.2.40

- Redesigned Home: your tools with their shortcut, the models in use and quick actions.
- New Voice Notes → Recording & Model section.
- Optional time limit for dictations and notes.
- The app no longer quits when you open the menu during a meeting.
]]></description>
